@startuml deployment-overview
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title SIMDP - Deployment Overview Diagram

node "Developer Machine" {
    [Next.js Dev Server\n(npm run dev)] as DevServer
    database "Local File Storage\n(uploads/)" as LocalStorage
    database "Local PostgreSQL\n(or Supabase Remote)" as LocalDB
}

node "Vercel (Production)" {
    [Next.js Serverless Functions\n(App Router + API Routes)] as VercelApp
    [Vercel Cron Jobs] as VercelCron
}

node "Supabase (Production)" {
    database "PostgreSQL Database" as SupabaseDB
    [Supabase Storage (optional)] as SupabaseStorage
}

node "AWS S3 (optional)" {
    [S3 Bucket\n(File Documents)] as S3
}

node "Email Provider (Production)" {
    [SMTP / SendGrid / Resend] as EmailProvider
}

note right of VercelApp
  Environment Variables:
  - DATABASE_URL
  - JWT_SECRET
  - STORAGE_PROVIDER (local|supabase|s3)
  - NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL
end note

DevServer --> LocalDB : Prisma (dev)
DevServer --> LocalStorage : local upload (dev)

VercelApp --> SupabaseDB : Prisma (prod)
VercelApp --> SupabaseStorage : IStorageProvider (supabase)
VercelApp --> S3 : IStorageProvider (s3)
VercelApp --> EmailProvider : SMTP / REST API
VercelCron --> VercelApp : POST /api/v1/cron/expiry\nPOST /api/v1/cron/reminder

@enduml
